# Root-level image guard (council W8, issue #119): screenshots and working
# images accumulate in the repo root during processing sessions; a bulk
# `git add` would publish them (with GPS EXIF) to this public repo. Gallery
# assets live in src/assets/img/ and are unaffected by these root-only rules.
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.png
